+
+Date: 2026-10-04. Existing workspace: `D:\nitheesh\vibe-trader-ai`. No project rebuild, new model, new dependencies, database migration or trading/authentication changes.
+
+## Verified results
+
+| Check | Status | Evidence / scope |
+| --- | --- | --- |
